==[[Range/Lore|The Range's lore assets]]==
===[[Range/Lore/EP7|Episode 7]]===
*{{AC|file=VoicemailBrimstone55.mp3}} "[[Brimstone]], it's Deadlock. Training on the prosthetic is coming along. I'm adjusting to the, uh, added weight. The recoil compensation is very nice also. Once it's dialed in, my... my aim will be even better than it was before. I... I know the restoration, the arm, the new nanowire spooling, it was an investment. In me. I wish things turned out differently but... well, thank you."
*{{AC|file=VoicemailBrimstone57.mp3}} "Brimstone, the radivore response project continues. Just like at The Vault, the technology will sunder them from within, no extraction chamber needed. Until then, the [[Kingdom Corporation|Kingdom]] site is in danger. Without a proper remedy, the wound they've opened will fester. That's all."
*{{AC|file=VoicemailBrimstone61.mp3}} "I saw you rejected my latest proposal, but I must insist you reconsider. Does VALORANT store unsecured warheads in the barracks? Do we leave mines scattered around the hallway, hmm? No! Those things are far worse. I fabricated four crates for this specific purpose. It is safe. You must authorize their detainment!"

===[[Range/Lore/EP8|Episode 8]]===
*{{AC|file=VoicemailBrimstone85.mp3}} "Brimstone, it's Deadlock. This Hourglass facility is astonishing. The surface level security is all in place. 3-factor biometric entry, dual-encrypted transmission hardware, but you need to see the containment areas deeper in the facility. The materials here make Svalbard look almost... amateur! I don't know what they were keeping here, but to warrant this many layers of security... it must have been something special. I'll bring back samples for further analysis."

===[[Range/Lore/EP9|Episode 9]]===
*{{AC|file=VoicemailBrimstone99.mp3}} "Brimstone, I'm requesting a leave of absence. I received word that the memorial to Ståljegerne now is completed. I've been invited to its opening ceremony and was asked to prepare... and-... and I was asked to prepare a speech for my sisters, and, uh... If I may go? Please?"
*{{AC|file=VoicemailBrimstone102.mp3}} "Brimstone, I know this is highly unusual but do you know [[Skye]]'s exact shoe size? It's not listed in her personal records. Her hiking boots are in dire need of replacement. Something must be done. Oh, and please don't mention I asked. It's a surprise."

